WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:15.513
"What?" Ally gulped.

2
00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:20.256
"Did you say we have to fight off extraterrestrials, Dr.

3
00:00:20.296 --> 00:00:23.479
Lloyd?" The alien life expert shrugged.

4
00:00:23.499 --> 00:00:27.001
"Well, there's a small chance they've come to Earth in peace.

5
00:00:28.042 --> 00:00:30.664
But either way, I need to share everything that I've learned.

6
00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:33.858
That's why I'm having a special exhibit at the convention."

7
00:00:33.878 --> 00:00:37.860
"Sounds great," Ally said with a smile.

8
00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:40.802
"Well, I've got to get going now."

9
00:00:40.822 --> 00:00:42.924
"Oh, but you can't leave!"

10
00:00:43.324 --> 00:00:44.144
Dr. Lloyd said.

11
00:00:44.164 --> 00:00:47.507
"I want to give you a sneak preview of my exhibit.

12
00:00:47.907 --> 00:00:49.448
And I won't take no for an answer."

13
00:00:49.468 --> 00:00:51.829
"You sure?"

14
00:00:52.370 --> 00:00:53.531
Ally asked nervously.

15
00:00:54.351 --> 00:00:56.192
Dr. Lloyd laughed.

16
00:00:56.392 --> 00:00:59.294
"You are a funny one, Ally!

17
00:00:59.775 --> 00:01:01.376
Come along, the exhibit is this way."

18
00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.963
He led Ally to a small gallery at the end of the main exhibit hall.

19
00:01:08.463 --> 00:01:12.226
As Ally passed through the doorway, a loud alarm sounded, sending Ally jumping.

20
00:01:13.527 --> 00:01:14.508
Dr. Lloyd groaned.

21
00:01:15.829 --> 00:01:19.692
"I forgot all about the new metal detector that Security installed.

22
00:01:21.954 --> 00:01:24.656
Just empty your pockets of anything metal and put it on the tray."

23
00:01:24.676 --> 00:01:29.780
"Okay." Ally took off her bracelet and hair clip and started through the doorway again.

24
00:01:34.208 --> 00:01:34.448
Brrp! Brrp!

25
00:01:34.468 --> 00:01:34.668
"Hmm." Dr.

26
00:01:34.688 --> 00:01:35.288
Lloyd frowned.

27
00:01:35.308 --> 00:01:38.450
"Perhaps you've forgotten to remove a piece of jewelry?"

28
00:01:39.410 --> 00:01:40.151
Ally shook her head.

29
00:01:44.873 --> 00:01:46.013
Dr. Lloyd pointed to her neck.

30
00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.954
"I see a necklace chain.

31
00:01:48.394 --> 00:01:50.235
Slip that off, and you can breeze right through."

32
00:01:50.975 --> 00:01:54.197
Ally's hand flew up to where her meld medallion was hidden beneath her clothes.

33
00:01:54.677 --> 00:01:55.777
"I can't take this off!"

34
00:01:55.797 --> 00:01:57.758
"Why not?"

35
00:01:57.778 --> 00:01:59.699
"What do I do?"

36
00:02:00.139 --> 00:02:01.220
Ally thought frantically.

37
00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.662
"If I take it off, I'll revert to my Astralian form!"

38
00:02:04.682 --> 00:02:11.208
"Um, because when my parents gave it to me, they warned me never to take it off.

39
00:02:12.289 --> 00:02:14.070
It would be bad luck!

40
00:02:14.470 --> 00:02:16.572
I'll just leave and come back another time."

41
00:02:17.413 --> 00:02:18.594
Ally turned to go, but Dr.

42
00:02:18.614 --> 00:02:19.314
Lloyd stopped her.

43
00:02:19.334 --> 00:02:21.156
"Don't be silly.

44
00:02:21.476 --> 00:02:23.638
I'll just ask the guards to turn the alarm off.

45
00:02:24.639 --> 00:02:27.741
They've been having lots of problems with these metal detectors anyway.

46
00:02:28.181 --> 00:02:28.642
Come along.

47
00:02:28.942 --> 00:02:31.044
I can't wait to let you peek at my findings!"

48
00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:38.884
Ally trudged after Dr.

49
00:02:38.924 --> 00:02:40.645
Lloyd, trying to hide her frustration.

50
00:02:41.385 --> 00:02:44.106
So far, her shopping trip for parts was a total failure.

51
00:02:47.067 --> 00:02:51.128
Inside the gallery the walls were covered in large drawings of extraterrestrial beings.

52
00:02:52.288 --> 00:02:54.009
Dr. Lloyd stopped in front of one of them.

53
00:02:55.109 --> 00:03:00.211
To Ally, the creature in the sketch looked strange, like a combination of a GreyZoner and a Gorphelian.

54
00:03:01.411 --> 00:03:01.851
But Dr.

55
00:03:01.891 --> 00:03:03.652
Lloyd was pointing proudly to the sketch.

56
00:03:04.232 --> 00:03:10.377
"According to my research, the life-forms on Gamma89B are much more technologically advanced than we Earthlings are."

57
00:03:10.397 --> 00:03:12.960
"Huh?" Ally thought.

58
00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:16.122
She'd never heard of a planet called Gamma89B.

59
00:03:17.263 --> 00:03:20.426
Next he showed her a model of a weapon called a delta hydroblaster.

60
00:03:21.367 --> 00:03:23.689
"This is a very popular weapon among aliens.

61
00:03:24.490 --> 00:03:28.153
It has the power to disintegrate a cement wall in an instant.

62
00:03:28.833 --> 00:03:31.576
If they attack us with these, we'll be utterly defenseless."

63
00:03:32.712 --> 00:03:34.614
Ally forced a smile to hide her surprise.

64
00:03:34.634 --> 00:03:38.958
"There's no such thing as a delta hydroblaster," she thought.

65
00:03:38.978 --> 00:03:41.360
"What in the world is he talking about?"

66
00:03:43.421 --> 00:03:43.962
Then Dr.

67
00:03:43.982 --> 00:03:46.564
Lloyd showed her a map of the outer reaches of the universe.

68
00:03:46.584 --> 00:03:50.568
"Everything is mislabeled!"

69
00:03:50.908 --> 00:03:51.849
Ally thought in horror.

70
00:03:51.869 --> 00:03:53.590
"I can't let Dr.

71
00:03:53.650 --> 00:03:56.493
Lloyd go on believing all this crazy stuff.

72
00:03:57.193 --> 00:03:59.776
Astralians are supposed to enlighten the universe!"

73
00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:02.601
"You know, Dr.

74
00:04:02.641 --> 00:04:04.262
Lloyd," she said carefully.

75
00:04:04.282 --> 00:04:09.485
"My mother is an astronomer, so she's taught me a lot about space."

76
00:04:10.946 --> 00:04:12.267
This wasn't really a lie.

77
00:04:13.168 --> 00:04:17.671
Ally's mother, like every other adult on Astralia, had completed advanced studies in astronomy.

78
00:04:20.372 --> 00:04:21.793
"Fascinating!" Dr.

79
00:04:21.813 --> 00:04:22.334
Lloyd said.

80
00:04:22.354 --> 00:04:24.575
"So what do you think of all my discoveries?"

81
00:04:24.595 --> 00:04:31.540
"First of all, I doubt extraterrestrials want to hurt humans," Ally said.

82
00:04:32.596 --> 00:04:35.899
"If you think about it, space is a very quiet place.

83
00:04:37.220 --> 00:04:39.462
Why would anyone want to disturb the peace?"

84
00:04:40.643 --> 00:04:41.423
She held her breath.

85
00:04:41.864 --> 00:04:44.626
Her argument didn't really make a lot of sense, but Dr.

86
00:04:44.646 --> 00:04:46.347
Lloyd cocked his head, looking intrigued.

87
00:04:46.367 --> 00:04:48.669
"Interesting theory!"

88
00:04:48.929 --> 00:04:49.330
he said.

89
00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:55.114
"Now I really insist—you must come to Friday's opening as my special guest.

90
00:04:56.395 --> 00:04:58.697
My colleagues are other leading experts in the field.

91
00:04:59.217 --> 00:05:02.100
You'll have the opportunity to discuss lots of your ideas."

92
00:05:03.624 --> 00:05:05.225
"Awesome!" Ally said quickly.

93
00:05:05.246 --> 00:05:07.327
"Thanks—see you at the opening!"

94
00:05:07.828 --> 00:05:09.669
As she hurried off, her mind was racing.

95
00:05:09.689 --> 00:05:14.694
"I absolutely have to be gone by Friday now," she thought.

96
00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:21.040
"Being in a room full of experts on alien life sounds dangerous—really, really dangerous!"
